  <ifrs-full:ChangesInMethodsAndAssumptionsUsedInPreparingSensitivityAnalysis contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfRisksAxis_ifrs-full_CurrencyRiskMember_ifrs-full_CurrencyInWhichInformationIsDisplayedAxis_dart_EURMember" xml:lang="ko">민감도분석시에는 이자율과 같은 다른 변수는 변동하지 않는다고 가정하였습니다.</ifrs-full:ChangesInMethodsAndAssumptionsUsedInPreparingSensitivityAnalysis>
  <ifrs-full:ChangesInMethodsAndAssumptionsUsedInPreparingSensitivityAnalysis contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfRisksAxis_ifrs-full_CurrencyRiskMember_ifrs-full_CurrencyInWhichInformationIsDisplayedAxis_dart_CNYMember" xml:lang="ko">민감도분석시에는 이자율과 같은 다른 변수는 변동하지 않는다고 가정하였습니다.</ifrs-full:ChangesInMethodsAndAssumptionsUsedInPreparingSensitivityAnalysis>
