  <entity01390344:DescriptionOfDepositsOfDisclosureOfDebtToEquityRatioAndNetBorrowingRatioLineItemsOfDisclosureOfDebtToEquityRatioAndNetBorrowingRatioTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" xml:lang="ko">예금은 현금및현금성자산 및 장ㆍ단기금융상품이 포함되어 있습니다.</entity01390344:DescriptionOfDepositsOfDisclosureOfDebtToEquityRatioAndNetBorrowingRatioLineItemsOfDisclosureOfDebtToEquityRatioAndNetBorrowingRatioTableOfItems>
  <entity01390344:DescriptionOfBorrowingsOfDisclosureOfDebtToEquityRatioAndNetBorrowingRatioLineItemsOfDisclosureOfDebtToEquityRatioAndNetBorrowingRatioTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" xml:lang="ko">사채의 경우 사채액면가액에서 사채할인발행차금이 차감되어 있습니다.</entity01390344:DescriptionOfBorrowingsOfDisclosureOfDebtToEquityRatioAndNetBorrowingRatioLineItemsOfDisclosureOfDebtToEquityRatioAndNetBorrowingRatioTableOfItems>
