  <entity01390344:DescriptionOfObjectivesAndProcessesForHedgedRisk contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 장래에 선박대금 등의 입금시 예상되는 환율변동 위험 등을 회피할 목적으로 ㈜하나은행 외 24개 은행과 파생상품계약을 체결하고 있으며, 모든 파생상품의 공정가치는 거래은행이 제공한 선도환율을 이용하여 평가하였습니다.</entity01390344:DescriptionOfObjectivesAndProcessesForHedgedRisk>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfHedgingInstrumentsUsedToHedgeRiskExposuresAndHowTheyAreUsed contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_DesignatedPurposeOfDerivativesAxis_ifrs-full_FairValueHedgesMember_dart_DerivativeContractTypeAxis_dart_ForeignCurrencyRelatedMember_dart_DerivativesTypeAxis_ifrs-full_ForwardContractMember" xml:lang="ko">외화도급계약 중 확정계약의 요건을 충족하는 계약에 대해 환율변동위험을 회피</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfHedgingInstrumentsUsedToHedgeRiskExposuresAndHowTheyAreUsed>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfHedgingInstrumentsUsedToHedgeRiskExposuresAndHowTheyAreUsed contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_DesignatedPurposeOfDerivativesAxis_ifrs-full_CashFlowHedgesMember_dart_DerivativeContractTypeAxis_dart_ForeignCurrencyRelatedMember_dart_DerivativesTypeAxis_ifrs-full_ForwardContractMember" xml:lang="ko">외자재 도입 관련 외화지출 예상분의 환율변동에 따른 현금흐름위험을 회피</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfHedgingInstrumentsUsedToHedgeRiskExposuresAndHowTheyAreUsed>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfHedgingInstrumentsUsedToHedgeRiskExposuresAndHowTheyAreUsed contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_DesignatedPurposeOfDerivativesAxis_ifrs-full_CashFlowHedgesMember_dart_DerivativeContractTypeAxis_dart_ForeignCurrencyRelatedMember_dart_DerivativesTypeAxis_ifrs-full_SwapContractMember" xml:lang="ko">외화부채의 금리 및 환율변동에 따른 현금흐름위험을 회피</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfHedgingInstrumentsUsedToHedgeRiskExposuresAndHowTheyAreUsed>
