  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfDetailsOfGuaranteesGivenOrReceivedOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity01390344_HdKoreaShipbuildingOffshoreEngineeringCoLtdMemberOfIntermediateParentMemberOfDisclosureOfRelatedPartyGuaranteeOrCollateralTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity01390344_PerformanceGuaranteeMaterialSupplyLicenseServiceProvideContractMemberOfReceivedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfRelatedPartyGuaranteeOrCollateralTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당기말 현재 당사는 HD한국조선해양㈜으로부터 당사가 수행중인 Saudi Engines Manufacturing Company와의 자재 공급, 라이선스, 용역 제공 계약에 대해 이행보증을 제공받고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfDetailsOfGuaranteesGivenOrReceivedOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction>
  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfDetailsOfGuaranteesGivenOrReceivedOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity01390344_HdKoreaShipbuildingOffshoreEngineeringCoLtdMemberOfIntermediateParentMemberOfDisclosureOfRelatedPartyGuaranteeOrCollateralTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity01390344_ConstructionPerformanceGuaranteeShwePhase3EpcicProjectMemberOfReceivedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfRelatedPartyGuaranteeOrCollateralTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당기말 현재 당사는 SHWE Phase 3 EPCIC Project 공사계약(계약금액 USD 473,730천)과 관련하여 HD한국조선해양㈜로부터 공사이행보증을 제공받고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfDetailsOfGuaranteesGivenOrReceivedOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction>
  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfDetailsOfGuaranteesGivenOrReceivedOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity01390344_HdKoreaShipbuildingOffshoreEngineeringCoLtdMemberOfIntermediateParentMemberOfDisclosureOfRelatedPartyGuaranteeOrCollateralTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity01390344_ConstructionPerformanceGuaranteeFpuProjectMemberOfReceivedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfRelatedPartyGuaranteeOrCollateralTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당기말 현재 당사는 FPU Project 공사계약(계약금액 USD 1,440,138천)과 관련하여 HD한국조선해양㈜로부터 공사이행보증을 제공받고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfDetailsOfGuaranteesGivenOrReceivedOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction>
  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfDetailsOfGuaranteesGivenOrReceivedOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity01390344_HdKoreaShipbuildingOffshoreEngineeringCoLtdMemberOfIntermediateParentMemberOfDisclosureOfRelatedPartyGuaranteeOrCollateralTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity01390344_ConstructionPerformanceGuaranteeUsNavalVesselMaintenanceContractMemberOfReceivedPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfRelatedPartyGuaranteeOrCollateralTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당기말 현재 당사는 미국 함정 정비협약 체결에 따라 체결된 계약에 한정하여 2024년 5월부터 2029년 7월까지 HD한국조선해양㈜로부터 USD 270,000천 한도로 이행보증을 제공받고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfDetailsOfGuaranteesGivenOrReceivedOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction>
  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfDetailsOfGuaranteesGivenOrReceivedOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_CategoriesOfRelatedPartiesAxis_entity01390344_HdKoreaShipbuildingOffshoreEngineeringCoLtdMemberOfIntermediateParentMemberOfDisclosureOfRelatedPartyGuaranteeOrCollateralTableOfMember_dart_TypesOfPaymentGuaranteesAxis_entity01390344_CorporateDebtBeforePhysicalSpinOffMemberOfMiscellaneousPaymentGuaranteeMemberOfDisclosureOfRelatedPartyGuaranteeOrCollateralTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 2019년 6월 1일을 분할기일로 하여 투자사업부문 등을 영위할  HD한국조선해양㈜(분할 전 현대중공업㈜)와 선박건조 등을 수행하는 사업부문을 영위할 분할신설법인인 HD현대중공업㈜로 물적분할하였습니다. 이와 관련하여 당사와 HD한국조선해양㈜(분할 전 현대중공업㈜)의 채무에 대하여 연대하여 변제할 책임이 있습니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfDetailsOfGuaranteesGivenOrReceivedOfOutstandingBalancesForRelatedPartyTransaction>
